 "bloques": [
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Ask with courtesy",
   "texto": [
    "**Ich hätte gern** (I wish) is very polite. With another verb, **würde** + infinitive is used at the end: **Ich würde gern im Team arbeiten** (I would like to work as a team).",
    "**Könnten** (could) is the courtesy form of **können**: **Könnten Sie das wiederholen?** (could you repeat it?)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Useful forms",
   "texto": [
    "**Wäre** (would) comes from **sein**: **Das wäre toll** (would be great). **Hätte** (would / would) comes from **haben**: **Ich hätte gern einen Termin** (would like an appointment). **Ich will** expresses will directly; for a request you can use **bitte**, **möchte**, **hätte gern**, **würde gern** or **könnten Sie …?**, according to the phrase."
   ]
  },
